      "content": "thanks. this is a good start. i want to get more specific for the training. when we talk about 'furtive movements' or 'suspicious' body language in these urban zones, what kind of specific looks or vibes should officers be trained to recognize? like, are there certain ways people dress or ways groups of people act together that are common precursors to trouble in these types of neighborhoods?",
